ong with fresh nexus certificate from an independent Chartered Engineer.\n\nSources:\n- HBP2023_Chapter05.pdf | HBP Chapter 5 | 5.01 Policy | Pages 2\n- HBP2023_Chapter05.pdf | HBP Chapter 5 | 5.03 Nexus Certification | Pages 2\n- HBP Chapter 2.pdf | HBP Chapter 2 | 2.97 Application to EPCG Committee | Pages 52\n- HBP2023_Chapter05.pdf | HBP Chapter 5 | 5.25 Clubbing of EPCG authorisations | Pages 14, 15"}
