ies already made till any amendm...\n- (c) The export of SCOMET items shall not be permitted against an Authorisation until and unless the requisite SCOMET Authorisation is obtained by the applicant.\n\nSources:\n- HBP2023_Chapter08.pdf | HBP Chapter 8 | 8 Nominee of Development Commissioner of MSME: Member | Pages 3\n- HBP2023_Chapter04+as+on+20.04.2026.pdf | HBP Chapter 4 | 4.49 Regularisation of Bonafide Default | Pages 29, 30, 31\n- HBP Chapter 2.pdf | HBP Chapter 2 | 2.77 Registering Authorities | Pages 34\n- HBP2023_Chapter04+as+on+20.04.2026.pdf | HBP Chapter 4 | 4.84 Exports against Advance Authorisation | Pages 50, 51, 52\n- HBP-Chapter-6.pdf | HBP Chapter 6 | 6.40 Time Bound Disposal of Applications | Pages 23, 24"}
